  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I thinkz it would be good that users have the option to turn on a country flag that appears on their 'Details' when others check it.\n\nVRChat could try to auto-detect our countries when we first open VRChat after such feature update, and it will display it for them to confirm, but if it is wrong they have the option to change it, and it will be permanent. (Giving a prompt of such and if they're sure of their choice)\n\nAlso the ability to toggle it on and off cause some may not want their country to be displayed (off by default maybe?).",
